<InfoPage path="/support/" label="Support guide" heading="Finding Yarrwin Support Safely" title="Yarrwin Support Guide | Account and Login Help" description="Find safer ways to resolve Yarrwin login, account, payment and app questions without sharing passwords, OTPs or payment details." >
  <h2>Use the account help route</h2><p>Start with the help or support option visible after you open the verified platform address. Describe the problem without including your password, OTP, full payment details or recovery codes.</p>
  <h2>What to include</h2><p>A useful request can include the time of the problem, the device type, a short error message and a transaction reference with sensitive parts hidden. Screenshots should be cropped before sharing.</p>
  <h2>Spot fake support</h2><p>Be cautious of accounts that contact you first, promise instant recovery or ask for remote access. Move the conversation back to the platform’s support area and keep copies of relevant case numbers.</p>
</InfoPage>
